ind":"update","title":"Demo update: co-op, staff and new rooms","summary":"A big update for the demo. Here's what's new.Co-op for up to 4 playersInvite your friends through Steam and run the same warehouse together. One sorts, one serves, one knocks everything over. The difficulty scales with your group. Hire some helpA porter who runs goods to the counter, a mule who carries what you can't, and a cat who gathers matching items into one pile and falls asleep on it. Every hire costs upkeep each night.Rooms with a purposeNew rooms come with a station: a trapdoor to the f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:54:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940250","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4873920-1842212951310459","game_id":"steam-4873920","kind":"update","title":"Patch notes v0.11","summary":"NewNew Garden: The shop now sits in a fully redesigned garden with updated walls, lawn, and doors. The weather is dynamic too: rain, hail and snow blow through it, and calm days get a gentle breeze.Expressive Characters: All characters feature hand-drawn faces that react to actions and events. FixedChest & Item Durability Warnings: Cracks and rattles clearly warn you before a chest breaks, and items now alert you when they are one drop away from breaking, so you can save them.Improved Visibility","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T14:53:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4873920-1841579228667315","game_id":"steam-4873920","kind":"announcement","title":"Stash Mayhem Demo Available Now!","summary":"The Demo is Live! The day has finally arrived: the Stash Mayhem Demo is officially available to play on Steam right now! Step into the shoes of a medieval warehouse manager, organize chaotic stashes, manage potions, scrolls, and magical loot, and see if you have what it takes to keep order amidst the chaos. How You Can HelpAs an indie studio, your support makes all the difference! Play the Demo: Download it directly from the Steam store page and give it a try. Wishlist the Game: If you enjoy you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T01:41:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667315","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4873920-1839041357032192","game_id":"steam-4873920","kind":"announcement","title":"Stash Mayhem Playtest is Live","summary":"The playtest is live now and stays open for one week, closing August 1st. You should see it in your Steam library. If not, restart Steam, or hit \"Request Access\" on the store page. This is an early build, so expect rough edges. What we're testing Does the core loop feel good: sorting deliveries, serving customers, racing the clock? Is the pressure fun or just stressful? Where do you get confused, stuck, or bored? When a run ends, do you want to start another one? How to send feedback In game: a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-25T16:12:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357032192","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4873920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4873920":"2026-10-26T04:48:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4873920